# Layering

```text
Station.App -> Station.Workflow
Station.App -> Device.Client / Device.Contracts
Device.Client -> Device.Server -> Device.Contracts
Device.Drivers.* / Device.Simulators -> Device.Server / Contracts
```

- View: display/input only.
- ViewModel: call `IStationWorkflow` (and thin device facades later). No COM.
- Workflow: explicit states; no P/Invoke / SQL / HTTP.
- Drivers: only place for UDL COM / native handles.
